WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.338
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Why might people sing a

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.301
community song together?

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:12.584
The answer is: To celebrate and share ideas. Community songs can strengthen shared

00:00:12.584 --> 00:00:13.005
identity.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:18.847
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. What can songs teach

00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:19.179
children?

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:25.441
The answer is: Good values and useful messages. Songs may communicate values and

00:00:25.441 --> 00:00:25.857
knowledge.
